From d10066aa5241dd1739060fd2efc145e8abe580e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FP mod <fpmod@localhost>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:34:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/27] Battle digivolution: energy bar, Digivolve command, 3
 turns as the Champion form

Each party Digimon fills an energy bar by dealing and taking damage. Full, a
Rookie whose digivolution table names a Champion gets a third command,
Digivolve (it guards that turn). The Digi-Lab's digivolution effect (0xDD9 /
0xDDB) plays on the battlefield and it fights as the Champion (model,
animations, +30 % HP, MP, attack, defense, speed) for 3 turns, then the
effect plays again and it returns. Every battle end returns it first; the
save never sees the Champion form. F1 > Forbs Hidden Mods > Digivolve in
battle (settings "battle_digivolve", on by default). Native only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1oHeiADE8njqFxkaQnJAX
